Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.56,Title,,0,0,0,,Nobita's Wife-To-Be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.56,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(304,529)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby in this photo has grown this big already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time sure flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's a good student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he will graduate to become Junior High student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Senior High, then College.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if he can manage to, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After graduating from college, he will be an refined adult...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he will get married...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But only if someone marries you, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! That's mean of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is going to marry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I'm kind of concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:00:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I can't marry a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then in that case, why don't we go, see your future by ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the Time Machine to go to the future to see my Wife-To-Be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Wife-To-Be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wanna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna see or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is full of toilets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The site where my house had once stood, has become a public toilet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The streets are totally different!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mr. Nobi's house that once stood there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 10 years since they moved to the apartment around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a park now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,#68, the 12th floor. I am so thrilled to see my Wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very nervous. I wonder who my wife is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm knocking on the door
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a good idea to see my wife in this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.23,0:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have a peek on her secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use this transparent mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see through things using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw only from the behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Ms. Nobi doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My future is full of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught you! You sure are a naughty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Minamoto Shizuka, 25 years in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to your mother like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunetaro's mum is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to apologize to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobisuke always give my Sunetaro a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit that he's very mischievous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please discipline your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:04:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobisuke looks just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That means, I'm his father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His mum is Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude of you to talk like that with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad is a gentleman, but from whom on earth do you take after?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my son, Nobisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Nobisuke, be a good boy and properly do your studies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this to your father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming here to occupy my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home using the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He is too mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He is too energetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd have you been, all this time? Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is here to wish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being shy all of a sudden? You sure are a weird kid!
